# VITE_API_BASE_URL intentionally left unset here: this app is meant to be
# reachable from any device on the venue LAN at whatever IP the laptop
# running it has that day. apps/shared/lib/api.js derives the API URL from
# window.location.hostname when this isn't set, so opening this app at
# http://192.168.1.50:5176 automatically talks to http://192.168.1.50:8000/api
# with no editing required per event. Set this explicitly only if you need
# to override that (e.g. pointing at a different backend than the one that
# served this page).
